          "fact": "Saving a presentation as an image turns slide objects into a flattened picture.",
          "source": "https://support.microsoft.com/en-us/powerpoint/file-formats-that-are-supported-in-powerpoint"
        },
        {
          "fact": "Saving as an older presentation format can affect features unavailable in that format.",
          "source": "https://support.microsoft.com/en-us/powerpoint/file-formats-that-are-supported-in-powerpoint"
        },
        {
          "fact": "Missing fonts can change the way a presentation displays; PowerPoint supports embedding eligible fonts.",
          "source": "https://support.microsoft.com/en-us/office/fonts/benefits-of-embedding-custom-fonts"
