          "fact": "Scene-linear values need appropriate display processing; treating them like a display-ready JPEG changes the appearance.",
          "source": "https://openexr.com/en/latest/"
        },
        {
          "fact": "A reader may show the display window differently from the stored data window.",
          "source": "https://openexr.com/en/latest/TechnicalIntroduction.html"
        },
        {
